---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About | TOW ARCHIVE">
  <section class="about-simple" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
    <h1 id="about-heading" class="sr-only">About</h1>
    <p>TOW ARCHIVE is an evolving research archive by Tow Lichuan Deng. It brings together encounters with contemporary art and the questions that emerge from them.</p>
    <p>Exhibitions, Institutions, People, and Concepts offer different ways of exploring the same records. Murmurgrove, the living form on the homepage, evolves from their connections.</p>
    <p>My research focuses on curatorial practices, site-specific and public art, and the role of institutions in shaping how art circulates and acquires meaning. Written across Chinese, Japanese, and English, the archive is personal, selective, and open to revision.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .about-simple { max-width:720px; padding:var(--section-start-gap) 0 80px; min-height:65vh; }
  .about-simple h1 { font-size:var(--page-heading-size); line-height:1.2; font-weight:400; margin:0 0 42px; letter-spacing:-.04em; }
  .about-simple p { font-size:16px; line-height:1.85; margin:0 0 22px; }
</style>
